    <task id="LOCAL-00004" summary="Added Gen_name and StateMemory modules to harden data integrity, improve&#10;failure transparency, and eliminate repetitive UI setup.&#10;&#10;1) Canonical Filename Enforcement (No Duplicates Policy)&#10;&#10;- Introduced strict canonical name resolution (Unicode NFC + casefold).&#10;- Enforced one-to-one mapping: source image → canonical image → icon.&#10;- If a collision occurs:&#10;    - Incoming file is ignored&#10;    - Warning is logged&#10;    - No renaming, suffixing, or duplicate creation&#10;- Eliminates prior behavior that could generate anime2.png, anime (2).png, etc.&#10;- Ensures rename-safe behavior inside Icon Images library.&#10;&#10;2) Production-Grade Image Discovery Diagnostics&#10;&#10;Replaced shallow “No images found” error with explicit failure mode reporting.&#10;&#10;Now distinguishes:&#10;- Path does not exist&#10;- Unsupported file extension&#10;- Empty directory&#10;- Images exist only in subfolders while recursive is disabled&#10;- Folder contains only unsupported types&#10;&#10;Engine reports WHY zero images were found instead of only stating that none were found.&#10;&#10;3) Persistent UI State (QSettings)&#10;&#10;App now remembers:&#10;- Last selected input path&#10;- Last mode (file vs folder)&#10;- Last output directory&#10;- Recursive flag&#10;- Overwrite flag&#10;- Padding preset&#10;&#10;State restores automatically on startup and auto-saves on interaction.&#10;&#10;Impact:&#10;- Eliminates duplicate image creation&#10;- Hardens data integrity&#10;- Improves professional-grade diagnostics&#10;- Reduces repetitive workflow friction&#10;&#10;Status:&#10;Production-ready behavior for naming, diagnostics, and session persistence.">
